  "alaska":{collocations:["alaska range"],examples:[{en:"Like I said, perfect, if you live in Alaska.",zh:"像我说过的，完美，如果你住在阿拉斯加的话。"},{en:"Alaska and Hawaii were dependencies of the United States.",zh:"阿拉斯加和夏威夷过去是美国的属地。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "alaskan":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"But his obeying the ordinary driving commands of the Alaskan trail is no demonstration that he is yours. Any dog in Alaska would obey you as he obeyed.",zh:"他遵守阿拉斯加的驱赶命令并不意味着他就是你的狗，任何阿拉斯加的狗都会像他一样对你俯首贴耳。"},{en:"But this crab also suffers from something of an identity crisis: Imported king crab is often misnamed Alaskan king crab, because most people think that's the name of the crab.",zh:"但这种蟹类也遭受了类似于身份危机的问题: 由于大多数人认为阿拉斯加帝王蟹就是这种螃蟹的名字，进口帝王蟹通常被这样误称。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "albedo":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"A similar example of lowered albedo occurs when sea-ice melts and disappears, causing the darker coloured sea underneath to absorb more heat.",zh:"当海冰融化消失时，会同样降低反射率，导致深色的海底吸收更多的热量。"},{en:"Different varieties of the same plant can vary in how much light they reflect, a property called albedo, so selecting for higher-albedo crops would enhance the cooling effect from agriculture.",zh:"同一类植物的不同品种具有不同的反射率，而选择那些反射率更高的品种将能提高农业对控制全球变暖的贡献。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "alchemist":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Would you rather be an alchemist or a chemist?",zh:"那么，你想做一个炼金术士，还是一个化学家呢？"},{en:"At first glance, it all seems an alchemist's illusion.",zh:"乍看上去， 它完全象是一位炼金术士的幻术。"}],deepExplanation:""},
