  "alga":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Even more strangely, the researchers think the salamanders might inherit the alga from their parents.",zh:"更奇怪的是，研究人员认为这些海藻是火蜥蜴从它们父母那里继承来的。"},{en:"The town is the centre of a black-market trade in facai, a species of alga whose name is spelt and pronounced similarly to 'get rich'.",zh:"这座城镇是一个发菜黑市交易的中心。 发菜是一种藻类，在汉语里它的写法和发音类似于“发财”。"}],deepExplanation:""},
