  "ere":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Yet this we ask ere you leave us, that you speak to us and give us of your truth.",zh:"然而在你离开我们之前，对我们说话，把你的真理传述给我们。"},{en:"Yet, if death be in this cup, I bid thee think again, ere thou beholdest me quaff it.",zh:"不过，要是这杯药可以致我于死地，在你眼看着我一口吞下去之前，我请求你再想一想。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "erect":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"an imposing town hall, erected in 1892",zh:"一座气势宏伟的市政厅，建于1892年"},{en:"Police have erected barriers across the main roads into the town.",zh:"警察在进城的主要道路上设立了路障。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "erectus":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Her team is also interested in asking similar questions about human ancestors from East Africa, as well as later species of hominin, such as Homo erectus.",zh:"她的团队对于回答有关人类祖先来自东非的类似问题也有兴趣，以及原始人类的人种问题，比如原始人类的直立行走。"},{en:"The well-preserved fossils resemble Homo erectus, a species from the genus Homo that first appeared in Africa some two million years ago and quickly spread throughout Europe and much of Asia.",zh:"这些保存完好的化石类似于直立人，从��个属系的人类来说，最早是在二百万年前出现在非洲的一些地方，并迅速蔓延至整个欧洲和亚洲大部分地区。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "erie":{collocations:["lake erie","erie canal"],examples:[{en:"They drove north back home, where he would start chemotherapy at a cancer center in Erie.",zh:"他们驱车向北返回家中，要在伊利肿瘤治疗中心开始进行化疗。"},{en:"Kanzius started treatments in Erie that September and continued them at a hospital in Florida when he and Marianne went south for the winter.",zh:"那年九月份肯兹尤斯在伊利开始了治疗，去南方过冬时他们就去佛罗里达州的一个医院继续治疗。"}],deepExplanation:""},
