  "european":{collocations:["european union","european countries","european commission","european style","european parliament","european central bank","european community","european space agency"],examples:[{en:"European languages",zh:"欧洲的语言"},{en:"our European partners",zh:"我们的欧洲伙伴"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "eusocial":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Some insects, such as ants and bees, live in \"eusocial\" groups, in which different members carry out specialized jobs to help maintain the colony.",zh:"有些昆虫，比如蚂蚁和蜜蜂，住在‘群居社会’，这里不同的成员各自完成特定的工作以确保殖民地的运转。"},{en:"That challenges Wilson's theory by suggesting that blood ties are indeed what get eusocial groups started, the team concludes in tomorrow's issue of Science.",zh:"这就挑战了威尔森的理论，因为血缘关系确实是群居社会开始的原因。"}],deepExplanation:""},
