  "geochemical":{collocations:["geochemical prospecting","geochemical anomaly","geochemical process"],examples:[{en:"But there’s very little doubt that if methane emissions are as large as this, there will be severe biological and geochemical impacts.",zh:"但有一点很肯定，如果甲烷排放量确实是如此大，必将产生严重的生物和地球化学影响。"},{en:"He will have to make more observations and wait for geochemical analysis of the rocks Alvin has picked up to learn the answer to this question, but it's a start and Sinton is excited.",zh:"要揭开这一问题的秘底，他还须进行进一步的观测，并等待对阿尔文号采集的这些岩石所进行的地质化学分析结果。 而这还只是个开始，这不禁令辛顿倍感兴奋。"}],deepExplanation:""},
