  "geological":{collocations:["geological condition","geological structure","geological environment","geological survey","geological exploration","geological mapping","geological map","geological interpretation"],examples:[{en:"With geological maps, books, and atlases you can find out all the proven sites of precious minerals.",zh:"有了地质地图、书籍和地图册，你就可以找到所有已探明的珍贵矿藏的位置。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "geologically":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Apollo astronauts used seismometers during their visits to the Moon and discovered that the gray orb isn't a totally dead place, geologically speaking.",zh:"阿波罗航天飞船的宇航员们登月时使用地震检波器发现：这个灰色的星球，从地质学角度上讲，并不完全是一个死气沉沉的地方。"},{en:"\"It know it sounds horrible to say this, but geologically speaking, it was not a big earthquake at all,\" says Alessandro Martelli, a professor of antiseismic engineering at the University of Ferrara.",zh:"我知道这样说可能让人反感，但从地质学角度看，这并算不上太严重的地震，费拉拉大学地震预防工程师亚里山大.马特利说。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "geologist":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"He is also a geologist.",zh:"他也是一位地质学家。"},{en:"A senior Pakistani geologist says, however, that the trend could be due to large-scale irrigation schemes that began in the area at around the same time as the West's Industrial Revolution.",zh:"然而，一位资深巴基斯坦地质学家说，这个趋势也可能是因为这个地区与西方工业革命同时开始的大规模的灌溉计划造成的。"}],deepExplanation:""},
