  "hydration":{collocations:["hydration heat","heat of hydration"],examples:[{en:"The team believes one of the most important factors is hydration - the way skin collects and retains moisture.",zh:"科研人员称，其中最重要的因素是水合，指皮肤吸收水分、保持湿度的过��。"},{en:"Previous experiments and simulations, however, indicated that the free energy of hydration did not match this predicted linear trend.",zh:"然而，过去的研究和模拟表明，烷烃的水化自由能并不符合预计的线性变化趋势。"}],deepExplanation:""},
