  "hydrodynamic":{collocations:["hydrodynamic lubrication","hydrodynamic pressure","hydrodynamic dispersion","hydrodynamic transmission"],examples:[{en:"A second type of thermal escape is far more dramatic. This form of thermal escape is called hydrodynamic escape or, more evocatively, the planetary wind.",zh:"热逸过程的第二种情形更为奇特，可称为流体力学逃逸（hydrodynamic escape），用通俗一些的话说，叫做“行星风”（以便和“太阳风”呼应）。"},{en:"Evolution of stars of all masses takes place on a hydrodynamic time scale .",zh:"各种质量的恒星的演化，均以流体力学的时间尺度进行。"}],deepExplanation:""},
