  "hydrogen":{collocations:["hydrogen peroxide","hydrogen production","hydrogen sulfide","hydrogen bond","hydrogen content","hydrogen chloride","hydrogen bonding","hydrogen atom"],examples:[{en:"Water contains hydrogen and oxygen.",zh:"水含有氢和氧。"},{en:"Water can be reduced to oxygen and hydrogen by electrolysis.",zh:"水通过电解可以分解为氧和氢。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydrographic":{collocations:["hydrographic net","hydrographic survey"],examples:[{en:"The hydrographic survey mapped the ocean floor in detail.",zh:"水道测量详细绘制了海底地图。"},{en:"Hydrographic data is essential for safe navigation.",zh:"水道测量数据对安全航行至关重要。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydrologic":{collocations:["hydrologic cycle","hydrologic data"],examples:[{en:"While evaporation from the oceans is the primary vehicle for driving the surface-to-atmosphere portion of the hydrologic cycle, transpiration is also significant.",zh:"海洋的蒸发作用是水文循环中的主要方式，它使得水从地球表面进入大气层中，蒸腾作用也具有举足轻重的地位。"},{en:"Only when a system possesses natural or artificial boundariesthat associate the water within it with the hydrologic cycle may theentire system properly be termed hydrogeologic.",zh:"只有当某一地质系统拥有自然的或人工的界限，将该系统内的水与水文循环起来，这整个系统方能被恰当地称为与水文地质学相关。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydrological":{collocations:["hydrological cycle","hydrological regime","hydrological forecast"],examples:[{en:"The theme addresses the role of forests and trees outside forests to help moderate soil, hydrological and aquatic systems.",zh:"本主题处理森林及森林外树木帮助调节土壤、水文以及水生系统的作用。"},{en:"Climate change is expected to alter hydrological regimes and the patterns of freshwater resources availability with impacts on both rainfed and irrigated agriculture.",zh:"预计气候变化将改变水文体系和淡水资源来源的模式，这将对旱作和灌溉农业都有影响。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydroponic":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"And for those who prefer a healthier diet there is also a hydroponic greenhouse where fresh vegetables will grow all year round.",zh:"还为那些注意健康饮食者建造了温室，温室内熟菜用溶液培养，新鲜绿色食品一年四季络绎不绝。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydroponically":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Lettuce grown hydroponically requires no soil and uses less water.",zh:"水培种植的生菜不需要土壤，且用水更少。"},{en:"They raise tomatoes hydroponically in a greenhouse year-round.",zh:"他们全年在温室里用水培法种植西红柿。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydropower":{collocations:["hydropower station","hydropower engineering"],examples:[{en:"If we do it ourselves, only cheap energy from hydropower will do.",zh:"如果靠自力更生，只有靠水电站带来的廉价能源了。"},{en:"Developing hydropower more quickly would allow for increasing the renewable energy target above the envisaged government target without increasing the incremental cost of the program.",zh:"加快发展水电可以在不增加整个可再生能源开发方案总成本的同时，实现可再生能源发展的新目标。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydrosphere":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Geosphere, hydrosphere and atmosphere are fluids in motion; their main difference is their viscosity.",zh:"地圈，水圈和大气是流体；他们的主要差别是他们的黏性。"},{en:"Hitting candle every months also is very be necessary, but before waxing, should mix hydrosphere besmirch wipe up .",zh:"每月打一次蜡也是很有必要的，但是打蜡前要将水气和污渍擦干净。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "hydrothermal":{collocations:["hydrothermal solution","hydrothermal alteration","hydrothermal deposit","hydrothermal process","hydrothermal vent"],examples:[{en:"Banpo antimony deposit is a typical fracture - controlling and hydrothermal fluid filling deposit.",zh:"半坡锑矿床是典型的断裂控矿，热液充填型矿床。"},{en:"There exist two type mineral deposits including Fuzichong-type skarn deposit and Niuwei-type hydrothermal filling deposit in the Fuzichong Pb-Zn ore belt.",zh:"佛子冲铅锌成矿带包括两种矿床类型，即佛子冲式夕卡岩型矿床和牛卫式热液充填（交代）型矿床。"}],deepExplanation:""},
