  "immigrant":{collocations:["illegal immigrant","immigrant visa"],examples:[{en:"Has Anyone Ever Filed an immigrant Visa Petition on Your Behalf?",zh:"以前有人代表你的提出移民签证的申请么?。"},{en:"But \"the hostile part can be mobilized from time to time, \" by what he calls \"anti-immigrant entrepreneurs.",zh:"但是“敌对的那部分可能会不时地动员”，以他称之为“反移民企业家”的名义。"}],deepExplanation:""},
