  "impartially":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"If she gets the nod, Kagan says she will consider every case impartially and with commitment to principle.",zh:"Kagan 说如果她能通过，她将公平地处理每个案子并忠于原则办事。"},{en:"In order for the independent director to exercise his rights impartially and equitably, nothing can go without a constraint mechanism in addition to above-mentioned incentive mechanism.",zh:"为了让独立董事更公正与公平地履行他的职责, 除了上述的激励机制外, 一个有效的约束机制也是必不可少的."}],deepExplanation:""},
