  "irish":{collocations:["irish sea","irish coffee","irish republic","irish whiskey","irish republican army","irish potato","irish bull"],examples:[{en:"I am starting to sense that maybe I and people like me are to blame because it is we, the Irish people, who are paying with our jobs, livelihoods, health care and education.",zh:"我开始感觉到或许就是我以及像我这样��人，该受责备，因为就是我们，让爱尔兰人民，正在为我们的工作、生活、医疗卫生和教育买单。"},{en:"On the other hand, the Irish are also right to be suspicious of intentions in Brussels and Berlin.",zh:"另一方面，爱尔兰对于柏林和布鲁塞尔的意图持怀疑态度也是有道理的。"}],deepExplanation:""},
