  "irregularly":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Good golfers do better if they give themselves little time to prepare for their shots--and even better if they are distracted by researchers asking them to count irregularly spaced sounds.",zh:"优秀的高尔夫球手在击球前准备的时���越少成绩越好—即使被研究人员骚扰，让他们数不规则间隔的声响，最后击球成绩依然不俗。"},{en:"The glove went through a series of designs, with dots and patches of different shapes and colors, but the current version is covered with 20 irregularly shaped patches that use 10 different colors.",zh:"这个手套经过了一系列的设计，试过不同形状和颜色的点状和块状布料，不过目前的版本是覆盖着20种不规则形状、10种不同颜色的块状布料。"}],deepExplanation:""},
