  "isotopic":{collocations:["isotopic tracer"],examples:[{en:"The variations in isotopic ratios take place on the right time scale, and they mirror those seen in modern corals, he notes.",zh:"他说，同位素比例变化所发生的时间范围恰到好处，这与在现代珊瑚中的发现保持了一致。"},{en:"While initial research was aimed at looking at seasonal variations in diet, the isotopic tests pointed them instead to apparent gender variations.",zh:"虽然初始的研究是为了确定其食物随季节的变化，同位素测试让他们发现了明显的性别差异。"}],deepExplanation:""},
