  "metalworker":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Some scholars believe that this astrolabe was created by the prince in collaboration with an unnamed metalworker.",zh:"一些学者认为��这个星盘是奥马尔王子与一位无名金属制造工匠共同制作的。"},{en:"And soon after the Blessed One had eaten the meal provided by Cunda the metalworker, a dire sickness fell upon him, even dysentery, and he suffered sharp and deadly pains.",zh:"不久以后，圣尊已经吃了那个金属工人供奉的晚餐， 可怕的疾病跟随他，正是痢疾，他遭遇了剧烈和致命的痛苦。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "metamorphic":{collocations:["metamorphic rock","metamorphic complex","metamorphic grade","metamorphic petrology"],examples:[{en:"This metamorphic rock has been compressed for millions of years.",zh:"这种变质岩已经过数百万年的压缩。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "metaphor":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"She uses some wonderful images and metaphors in her writing.",zh:"她在作品中用了一些绝妙的比喻和暗喻。"},{en:"a very creative use of metaphor",zh:"隐喻的独到运用"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "metaphysical":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"A lot of scientists don’t like discussing metaphysical matters.",zh:"很多科学家不喜欢讨论形而上学的东西。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "metazoan":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"As the scientists conclude: \"Our results expand the known metazoan bio-sphere and demonstrate that deep ecosystems are more complex than previously accepted.",zh:"科学家总结道：“我们的研究结果扩展了已知的后生生物圈的范围，并揭示出，深层生态系统比我们之前想象的要复杂。"},{en:"Since the Middle Proterozoic, metazoan trace fossils must have undergone an irreversible evolution from simple to complicated, and from lower to higher in quality.",zh:"中元古代以来后生动物遗迹的演化过程在质上经历了由简单到复杂， 由低级到高级的发展、演变过程。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "meteor":{collocations:["meteor shower"],examples:[{en:"Astronomers track large meteors using radar.",zh:"天文学家使用雷达跟踪大型流星。"},{en:"a meteor shower",zh:"流星雨"}],deepExplanation:""},
