  "methodical":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"He always checked every detail in a methodical way.",zh:"他总是有条不紊地检查每一个细节。"},{en:"a methodical approach to answering questions",zh:"条理清楚的答题方式"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "methodically":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"As I methodically explained why each clue revealed too much, my husband dutifully crossed out the words.",zh:"我有条不紊地解释为什么每个线索都透露得太多，我丈夫就尽职地划去一些词。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "methyl":{collocations:["methyl methacrylate","methyl ester","methyl alcohol","methyl orange","methyl acetate","methyl ether","methyl acrylate","methyl cellulose"],examples:[{en:"However, thiomersal, the preservative in some vaccines, contains ethyl mercury not methyl mercury.",zh:"然而，在某些疫苗中用作防腐剂的硫柳汞含乙基汞，并非含甲基汞。"},{en:"Further, ethyl mercury is actively excreted via the gut, unlike methyl mercury, which accumulates in the body.",zh:"另外，乙基汞通过肠道被积极排除出去，而不像甲基汞那样在体内积累。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "meticulous":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"He kept meticulous accounts.",zh:"他的账记得一丝不苟。"},{en:"Their planning and preparation were meticulous.",zh:"他们的计划和准备工作都很周密。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "meticulously":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The archaeologist meticulously brushed away the dust from the ancient pottery shard.",zh:"考古学家小心翼翼地刷掉古代陶片上的灰尘。"},{en:"He meticulously planned every detail of the trip to avoid any unexpected delays.",zh:"他仔细地规划了旅行的每一个细节，以避免任何意外的延误。"}],deepExplanation:""},
