  "mexican":{collocations:["mexican war"],examples:[{en:"In fact, some even joined the Mexican force that put down his rebellion.",zh:"事实上，有些人还加入墨西哥的军队，镇压他的反叛。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "mexico":{collocations:["gulf of mexico","new mexico","mexico city","university of new mexico"],examples:[{en:"We want to prove that in Mexico.",zh:"我们要在墨西哥证明这一点。"},{en:"The United States bounds on Mexico in the south.",zh:"美国的南面与墨西哥接壤。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "miami":{collocations:["miami beach"],examples:[{en:"Do you have any flights to Miami?",zh:"你们有飞迈阿密的班机吗？"},{en:"Obviously that was the end of me in Miami.",zh:"很明显，这就是我在迈阿密的结局。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "miasmic":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The miasmic air of the swamp made it difficult to breathe without a mask.",zh:"沼泽地弥漫的瘴气使人不戴口罩就很难呼吸。"},{en:"A miasmic fog hung over the battlefield long after the fighting had ceased.",zh:"战斗停止很久后，战场上仍笼罩着一片毒气般的雾气。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "michigan":{collocations:["university of michigan","michigan state university"],examples:[{en:"He quotes some students from the University of Michigan.",zh:"他引述了几位密歇根大学学生的话。"},{en:"He points out that some past offenders in Michigan have been released only to cause havoc and end up in jail again.",zh:"他指出，过去密歇根释放的一些犯人只是与造成严重破坏的人有关，而且最后又都重新回到监狱里。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microbe":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"...a type of bacteria that include the microbes responsible for tuberculosis and leprosy.",zh:"…包括引起结核病和麻风病的微生物在内的一类细菌。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microbial":{collocations:["microbial degradation","microbial ecology","microbial activity","microbial contamination","microbial population","microbial cell","microbial flora"],examples:[{en:"...the question of whether microbial life exists, or once existed, on Mars.",zh:"...这个火星上是否存在或曾经存在过微生物的问题。"},{en:"Microbial infections now kill 17m people a year.",zh:"细菌感染现在每年杀死1700万人。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microbiologist":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"I remember when Jurassic Park came out, a microbiologist friend constantly told me how outlandish it was, but within a few years, he said it was interesting how far things have come.",zh:"我记得当《侏罗纪公园》出现的时候，一个微生物学家朋友不断的告诉我这影片太奇异了，但是在几年之内，他说影片中的科技到底还有多久才能实现很令人感兴趣。"},{en:"Scientists have been debating this issue since 1892, when Dmitry Ivanovsky, a Russian microbiologist, reported that an infection in tobacco plants spreads via something smaller than a bacterium.",zh:"自1892年以来科学家一直在争论这个(病毒是死是活的）问题。 当时俄罗斯微生物学家德米特里｀伊凡诺夫斯基报告说烟草中的一种病通过比细菌还要小的东西传播。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microcosm":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"In each one of these places you will find a microcosm of molecules which directly impact the look, smell, touch, and sound of everything that you see.",zh:"在每一个这样的地方，你都可以发现分子的微观世界，它们会直接影响你所见物质的外观、气味、触感和声音。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microfossil":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"This achievement provides the microfossil materials for the study of the lower ordovician in Northern Guizhou.",zh:"这一成果对于贵州北部下奥陶统的研究，提供了微体化石资料。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "micron":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"For example, if you say that something is \"a few microns across\", explain that a micron is one-millionth of a metre, and \"about one hundredth the width of a human hair\".",zh:"例如，如果您说某事物只有几微米，那么就要解释一微米是百万分之一米，大约是人头发宽度的百分之一。"},{en:"One micron is a thousandth of a millimeter: a pinhead is about a millimeter across.",zh:"一微米等于千分之一毫米。 针头直径大约一毫米。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "micronesian":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"The Micronesian navigators used traditional stick charts to cross vast ocean distances.",zh:"密克罗尼西亚的航海者使用传统的棍棒海图穿越广阔的海洋距离。"},{en:"She is learning Micronesian languages to better communicate with the local community.",zh:"她正在学习密克罗尼西亚语言，以便更好地与当地社区交流。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "micronutrient":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"It also recommends using multiple micronutrient powders to fortify foods for children aged between 6 and 23 months.",zh:"还建议利用多种微量营养素粉来强化年龄在6个月和23个月之间儿童的食物。"},{en:"This will involve improving access to nutritious food, to micronutrient supplementation and in many places to preventing infections as well.",zh:"这将包括改善营养食品和微量营养素补充品的获得，在许多地方还包括预防感染。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microorganism":{collocations:["pathogenic microorganism"],examples:[{en:"This is actually just a microorganism. But it has roughly 500 genes.",zh:"这其实只不过是一个微生物，却拥有约500个基因。"},{en:"Spread the contents of the amber onto a petri dish containing a microorganism food like starch or soy.",zh:"把琥珀内嵌标本放在皮氏培养皿中，并加入微生物食品，比如淀粉或大豆。"}],deepExplanation:""},
