  "microscopic":{collocations:["microscopic examination","microscopic observation","microscopic analysis","microscopic view"],examples:[{en:"a microscopic speck of dust",zh:"微小的尘粒"},{en:"Inspectors discovered microscopic cracks in the hull of the submarine.",zh:"检测人员发现潜艇的船身有细微的裂缝。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "microscopy":{collocations:["electron microscopy","scanning electron microscopy","transmission electron microscopy","optical microscopy","light microscopy","fluorescence microscopy","polarized light microscopy"],examples:[{en:"Not only might it have applications in fields such as microscopy, but it apparently also has the ability to optically store data forever.",zh:"它不仅可以在诸如显微镜之类的领域得到应用，显然它同时也具有实现永久性光存储的能力。"},{en:"An examination done on swabs from ulcers or smears from tissue biopsies that can be carried out rapidly at local health facilities where TB microscopy is also done.",zh:"对溃疡拭子或来自组织切片的涂片所做的一种检查，可在同时进行结核显微镜检查的地方卫生设施中快速进行。"}],deepExplanation:""},
