  "nonliving":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"In 1860 Louis Pasteur performed experiments that eventually disproved “spontaneous generation, ” the idea that life continually arose from nonliving things.",zh:"1860年，路易斯巴斯德做了个实验，最终反驳了“自然发生说”，这一说认为生命源源不断于无生命的物体。"},{en:"But bully life reaches deeper and ties up the entire planet in the web of its network, also roping in the nonliving matrix of rock and gas into its coevolutionary antics.",zh:"然而强悍的生命向更深处扎根，不但用它的网络将整个地球包裹起来，而且将没有生命的岩石和大气也串连进它的共同进化的怪诞行动之中。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "nonnative":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Removing sheep and cattle in an attempt to restore Santa Cruz Island, Calif., for example, let nonnative plants spread over the landscape unchecked.",zh:"例如，为了保护加利福利亚州的圣克鲁兹岛，除去羊和牛，让非本土植物不加抑制地广泛生长于此地。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "nonporous":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"As for your cutting board, use glass or plastic, both of which are nonporous and most resistant to germs.",zh:"玻璃或塑料材质的切菜板不会渗漏，预防细菌滋生效果最好。"},{en:"The nonporous and nonreactive hard-anodized surface resists sticking and doesn't affect the flavor or color of food.",zh:"无孔和无反应的硬阳极氧化表面抗粘，不影响味道或颜色的食物。"}],deepExplanation:""},
