  "permeability":{collocations:["low permeability","air permeability","relative permeability","permeability coefficient","gas permeability","water permeability","moisture permeability","effective permeability"],examples:[{en:"The most interesting dimension of this is what Google Search Appliance says about the increasing permeability of a company and the outside world.",zh:"其中，最有趣的一点是谷歌搜索设备所反映的“公司和外部世界日益增加的渗透性”。"},{en:"The idea behind enhanced, or engineered, geothermal systems is to inject water underground to enhance the permeability of rock, allowing for the release and capture of more heat.",zh:"增强型的或是工程型的地热系统将水注入到地下，使岩石的渗透性提高，这样便可以吸收或释放更多热量。"}],deepExplanation:""},
