  "phosphate":{collocations:["phosphate rock","phosphate fertilizer","calcium phosphate","ammonium phosphate","hydrogen phosphate","phosphate ester","sodium phosphate","zinc phosphate"],examples:[{en:"The role of these glands is to regulate calcium and phosphate in our bloodstream.",zh:"这些腺体的作用是稳定血液中钙质和磷酸盐的含量。"},{en:"They dissolved cobalt and phosphate in water and then zapped it with electricity through an electrode.",zh:"他们把钴和磷酸盐溶解到水溶液中，然后，通过电极对它们进行电解。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "phosphorescence":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Besides this, Javert possessed in his eye the feline phosphorescence of night birds.",zh:"况且沙威的眼睛有着夜鸟那种象猫一样的磷光。"},{en:"Whilst all the landscape was in neutral shade his companion's face, which was the focus of his eyes, rising above the mist stratum, seemed to have a sort of phosphorescence upon it.",zh:"当所有的景物都沐浴在明暗相宜的色调中的时候，他的同伴的脸就成了他眼睛注意的中心，那张脸从层层雾霭中显露出来，脸上似乎染上了一层磷光。"}],deepExplanation:""},
  "phosphorus":{collocations:["total phosphorus","yellow phosphorus","red phosphorus","phosphorus trichloride","phosphorus oxychloride","white phosphorus","phosphorus pentoxide"],examples:[{en:"Because scientists have found a bacterium that can do without phosphorus—live on arsenic instead.",zh:"因为科学家已经发现了一种细菌，可以无需磷生活而以砷代替。"},{en:"When mixed with sulfur, phosphorus, and the kind of heat you get from, say, friction, it's very unstable.",zh:"当与硫磺、磷、你从某处获得的某种热量（比如说摩擦力）混合时，它就变得很不稳定。"}],deepExplanation:""},
