  "photoflash":{collocations:[],examples:[{en:"Seven years later, through his work with Harold Eugene Edgerton of MIT, he made several photographic experiences of capturing sequences of actions using photoflash to immobilize the scene.",zh:"7年以后，通过与麻省理工学院 Harold Eugene Edgerton的合作，他进行了几次摄影的尝试，捕捉一系��运动的场景通过闪光灯来使画面固定。"},{en:"For photoflash , lug type, low loss factor and low leakage current.",zh:"闪光灯用产品，具有低损耗，低漏电等特点。"}],deepExplanation:""},
